    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Can't Have Another Planar Pact Feat)</em></p><p>You struck a bargain with a power of the Lower Planes. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Infernal Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to your choice of Fire or Poison damage.</p><p><strong>Infernal Sight.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 30 feet. Magical Darkness doesn't impede this Darkvision.</p><p><strong>Silver-Tongued.</strong> You gain proficiency in the Deception skill.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GOvFUXZQFDRsMqH6\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Infernal Sight</em> gives the 30 feet of Darkvision (or keeps a longer one).</p></section>",
